[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Software Requirements
PREFIX: REQ-

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-1
TITLE: Add two integers
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall provide a function that returns the sum of two integers.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-2
TITLE: Reject non-numeric input
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall raise a TypeError when the addition function is called with a non-numeric argument.
<<<
